7
00:00:30.596 --> 00:00:31.996
<I>No. Please do not! No.</I>

8
00:00:36.596 --> 00:00:39.896
7 MINUTES
Review. Synchronization by Angel.

9
00:00:39.973 --> 00:00:41.373
<I>Wake up.</I>

10
00:00:43.643 --> 00:00:45.043
