At least they got
to keep the casinos.

41
00:02:13.801 --> 00:02:17.236
I am telling you. We have
been cursed ever since.

42
00:02:17.238 --> 00:02:18.637
<i>Cursed?</i>

43
00:02:18.639 --> 00:02:20.606
<i>No. I am not cursed.</i>

44
00:02:20.608 --> 00:02:22.008
<i>You are cursed.</i>

45
