76
00:04:05.079 --> 00:04:06.345
Get over there in the corner.

77
00:04:06.347 --> 00:04:06.812
You. Too.

78
00:04:06.814 --> 00:04:07.613
Hurry up!

79
00:04:07.615 --> 00:04:08.814
Hey! Hurry up!

80
