You better not have said
nothing to nobody in there.

267
00:19:23.129 --> 00:19:26.063
I would say shit.

268
00:19:26.065 --> 00:19:28.533
You better not
have or I will kill you.

269
00:19:28.535 --> 00:19:30.001
I will drop your
body off somewhere.

270
00:19:30.003 --> 00:19:32.436
